{"id":"en_yellowstone-king-of-montana","title":"Yellowstone: King of Montana","titleEn":"Yellowstone: King of Montana","description":"Henry Conrad is the man behind the Yellowstone Ranch and the figure known as the King of Montana, yet he has spent years concealing who he really is by working as a school janitor. After a decade away, he is ready to return to his throne. Before he can reveal his true identity, however, his son is bullied, beaten and humiliated. Henry resolves to shield his son, see that the bullies answer for what they did, and correct the wrongs of the valley as a true King would.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/yellowstone-king-of-montana/it_IT/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/yellowstone-king-of-montana/it_IT/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Răzbunare","Rache","Revenge","Male","Secret Identity","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2va/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_yellowstone-king-of-montana_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2va/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_yellowstone-king-of-montana_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2va/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_yellowstone-king-of-montana_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2va/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_yellowstone-king-of-montana_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2va/?pub=4occak","kind":"e